av","referenceText":"啊啊啊他看我了！他真的看我了！我要晕了！我今天太幸福了！"},{"id":"real_emotion_02_07","displayName":"真人情绪·初雪｜慵懒起床","locale":"克隆·女性少年","gender":"female","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/d1/d1fef746e6557070151244312803a1c9aeb708f7537a014f888233d80a5578b3.wav","referenceText":"嗯...别吵我...再让我睡五分钟嘛...就五分钟...昨晚追剧到三点..."},{"id":"real_emotion_02_08","displayName":"真人情绪·云朵｜震惊吃瓜","locale":"克隆·女性少年","gender":"female","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/36/368e181369c567002d796e6fa520eabc70e33621812b20306b9e0cdec83ede27.wav","referenceText":"什么？！他们俩在一起了？我的天这也太劲爆了吧！什么时候的事！"},{"id":"real_emotion_02_09","displayName":"真人情绪·浅浅｜害怕走夜路","locale":"克隆·女性少年","gender":"female","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/8d/8d3a31adb3e47ca99e9902ba05ec436193f4c3214f092827f824c8acad863842.wav","referenceText":"后面好像有人跟着我...怎么办...我要不要跑...千万别回头..."},{"id":"real_emotion_02_10","displayName":"真人情绪·晚宁｜自信演讲","locale":"克隆·女性少年","gender":"female","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/67/6727a43f123758b44eba77ef959cb8d8f2a517dc6adc6c78756a8c801a9a163b.wav","referenceText":"我认为我们的方案是最可行的，下面我来详细说明一下，请大家认真听。"},{"id":"real_emotion_02_11","displayName":"真人情绪·念初｜撒娇卖萌","locale":"克隆·女性少年","gender":"female","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/29/291da19273c9c71b85940bf3fa6d274c9e4cbb7aae68b93a5fe1b22abd503640.wav","referenceText":"哎呀好闺蜜~你最好了~就帮我这一次嘛~下次我请你喝奶茶，超大杯的！"},{"id":"real_emotion_02_12","displayName":"真人情绪·若溪｜严肃认真","locale":"克隆·女性少年","gender":"female","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/b7/b73f55ab48db826aa1d2c1c7deab7c2a78431a5de4650e3be7447d160fa160df.wav","referenceText":"这个问题我们需要认真对待，不能再这样敷衍下去了，这关系到全班的荣誉。"},